  "contentHtml": "<p>2008년 BBC에서 제작한</p><p>&#39;Einstein and Eddington&#39; 영상에 대한 활동지입니다.</p><p>DVD로 판매하고 있는데, 학교에 아이들이 오면 보여줄 수 있지만</p><p>온라인으로는 어렵잖아요? ㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그런데 마침 에딩턴 역의 배우 유튜브에</p><p>에딩턴이 출연한 장면이 몽땅 나와 있어요. (주연인데요...ㅋㅋ)</p><p>중간에 아인슈타인만 나온 장면들이 조금 빠져있는데</p><p>채울만한 영상을 두어개 더 찾았습니다.</p><p>영상을 순서대로 재생목록에 담았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>자막이 문제인데요, 유튜브엔 자막이 없고</p><p>자동자막은 번역이... 그냥.. 아주 그냥... 발번역이라...</p><p>번역파일을 같이</p><p>&#160;올립니다. ㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDj7gu2Jca-Ba0L1rO1RHXO4bs6IcUUsY\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDj7gu2Jca-Ba0L1rO1RHXO4bs6IcUUsY</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Einstein and Eddington\" data-og-description=\" \" data-og-host=\"www.youtube.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDj7gu2Jca-Ba0L1rO1RHXO4bs6IcUUsY\" data-og-url=\"http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDj7gu2Jca-Ba0L1rO1RHXO4bs6IcUUsY\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hF3gs/hyICaY2TUD/Ovfo8ESUslid9soj6r86W0/img.jpg?width=168&amp;height=94&amp;face=79_25_125_75,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bRw38J/hyIB03bM8M/ukaaxr5u1qLdREuT3C9QuK/img.jpg?width=196&amp;height=110&amp;face=86_25_144_83,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/3T32H/hyIB6I6WBM/pKYF0vkSKBTVkfaBqEd9X0/img.jpg?width=246&amp;height=138&amp;face=116_38_187_115,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bRj6cy/hyIB0Wp9xm/8tkfXM7r82xcerMLfChzFk/img.jpg?width=336&amp;height=188&amp;face=153_47_258_162\"><a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDj7gu2Jca-Ba0L1rO1RHXO4bs6IcUUsY\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDj7gu2Jca-Ba0L1rO1RHXO4bs6IcUUsY\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hF3gs/hyICaY2TUD/Ovfo8ESUslid9soj6r86W0/img.jpg?width=168&amp;height=94&amp;face=79_25_125_75,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bRw38J/hyIB03bM8M/ukaaxr5u1qLdREuT3C9QuK/img.jpg?width=196&amp;height=110&amp;face=86_25_144_83,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/3T32H/hyIB6I6WBM/pKYF0vkSKBTVkfaBqEd9X0/img.jpg?width=246&amp;height=138&amp;face=116_38_187_115,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bRj6cy/hyIB0Wp9xm/8tkfXM7r82xcerMLfChzFk/img.jpg?width=336&amp;height=188&amp;face=153_47_258_162)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Einstein and Eddington</p><p class=\"og-desc\"> </p><p class=\"og-host\">www.youtube.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그래도 아쉬운 부분은 제가 자막 번역본에 채워놨네요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 전체 영상에 맞춰진 자막 smi파일</p><p>2. 전체 자막 txt파일</p><p>3. 유튜브 링크 모음</p><p>4. 활동지 (hwp)</p><p>5. 유튜브 링크에 맞는 자막</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이렇게 업로드합니다.</p><p>학기말 수업에 활용하세요~~</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ad8de97c5ea192ecfe9f8f95482725d7064f702c?download\" data-file-name=\"Einstein and eddington (2008).smi\" data-file-size=\"100897\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D166%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20201218120138&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fad8de97c5ea192ecfe9f8f95482725d7064f702c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">Einstein and eddington (2008)</span><span class=\"type\">.smi</span></div><div class=\"size\">98.53KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9fd7d26d6a4787c95cdf2cfe79c7cb541cb5301b?download\" data-file-name=\"Einstein and eddington (2008).txt\" data-file-size=\"100897\" data-mimetype=\"text/plain\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D166%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20201218120138&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F9fd7d26d6a4787c95cdf2cfe79c7cb541cb5301b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div cl